    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾰπά̆ν-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cost, expense,</i> mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
